---
title: Triple Chocolate Fudge
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Candy
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@condensed milk{1%can} (not evaporated)
@butter{2%Tbsp}
@white chocolate chips{0.5%cup}
@bittersweet chocolate{3%oz bar}
@chocolate chips{16%oz}
@chopped walnuts{0.5%cup}

Heat condensed milk and butter until butter melts. Off heat, stir in chocolate chips until melted. Stir in remaining ingredients. Spread in well-buttered 8 or 9 inch square pan and refrigerate until firm.
